{%- comment -%}
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  OTODOR Snippet: Campaign window
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Purpose:   Answer one question for every offer surface (promo strip, offer
             popup, product offer panel): is the campaign running right now?

  A seasonal sale that has to be switched off by hand is a sale that stays up
  until someone notices. The merchant types a start and an end date once in
  Theme settings → OTODOR Offers, Pricing & EMI; every surface reads this
  snippet, so the campaign appears and retires on its own.

  Params: none — it reads theme settings.

  Rules:
    otodor_offer_enabled off        → not live
    start set and still ahead       → not live
    end set and already past (end
      date is inclusive, to 23:59)  → not live
    otherwise                       → live

  Echoes `1` when live, nothing otherwise. Callers:
    {%- capture campaign_live -%}{%- render 'otodor-campaign-live' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if campaign_live == '1' -%} … {%- endif -%}
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign live = true

  unless settings.otodor_offer_enabled
    assign live = false
  endunless

  if live
    assign now_ts = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0

    if settings.otodor_campaign_start != blank
      assign start_ts = settings.otodor_campaign_start | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if start_ts > 0 and now_ts < start_ts
        assign live = false
      endif
    endif

    if live and settings.otodor_campaign_end != blank
      assign end_day = settings.otodor_campaign_end | append: ' 23:59:59'
      assign end_ts = end_day | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if end_ts > 0 and now_ts > end_ts
        assign live = false
      endif
    endif
  endif

  if live
    echo '1'
  endif
-%}
